[{"id":"monopoly-market::second-degree","scope":"economics","groupId":"monopoly-market","groupTitle":"垄断市场","groupTakeaway":"完全垄断模型中，相关市场只有一个卖者，产品缺少近似替代品，并有较高进入障碍。价格歧视则按支付意愿、数量段或群体形成差别收费，需区分差价来源与实现条件。","title":"二级价格歧视","content":"二级价格歧视是厂商按不同消费数量段规定不同价格，差别体现在购买数量或方案的选择上。它不同于直接按消费者身份划分群体，也不表示所有数量折扣都与成本差异无关。","label":"二级价格歧视","note":"二级价格歧视是厂商按不同消费数量段规定不同价格，差别体现在购买数量或方案的选择上。它不同于直接按消费者身份划分群体，也不表示所有数量折扣都与成本差异无关。","learningGoal":"说明二级价格歧视的含义。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"monopoly-market","tabId":"monopoly-price-discrimination","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p12-monopoly-price-discrimination-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=monopoly-market&tabId=monopoly-price-discrimination","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"acbc0e91"},{"id":"monopoly-market::third-degree","scope":"economics","groupId":"monopoly-market","groupTitle":"垄断市场","groupTakeaway":"完全垄断模型中，相关市场只有一个卖者，产品缺少近似替代品，并有较高进入障碍。价格歧视则按支付意愿、数量段或群体形成差别收费，需区分差价来源与实现条件。","title":"三级价格歧视","content":"三级价格歧视是厂商对不同市场或消费群体收取不同价格，区分依据是市场或群体，而不是逐单位识别最高支付意愿，也不是只按购买数量分段。","label":"三级价格歧视","note":"三级价格歧视是厂商对不同市场或消费群体收取不同价格，区分依据是市场或群体，而不是逐单位识别最高支付意愿，也不是只按购买数量分段。","learningGoal":"说明三级价格歧视的含义。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"monopoly-market","tabId":"monopoly-price-discrimination","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p12-monopoly-price-discrimination-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=monopoly-market&tabId=monopoly-price-discrimination","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"e24e2347"},{"id":"market-failure-meaning::allocation-efficiency","scope":"economics","groupId":"market-failure-meaning","groupTitle":"市场失灵的含义","groupTakeaway":"市场失灵讨论仅凭市场机制难以达到资源有效配置的情形。识别时要关注效率及作用条件，不能将个别经营者亏损、价格变化或市场存在政府参与直接等同于市场失灵。","title":"市场失灵：资源配置效率受损","content":"市场失灵是指仅依靠市场机制不能实现资源有效配置的情形。它讨论的是资源配置效率问题，不等于某家企业亏损，也不意味着所有市场交易都应停止。","label":"市场失灵：资源配置效率受损","note":"市场失灵是指仅依靠市场机制不能实现资源有效配置的情形。它讨论的是资源配置效率问题，不等于某家企业亏损，也不意味着所有市场交易都应停止。","learningGoal":"区分市场失灵与个别企业经营亏损。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"market-failure-meaning","tabId":"market-failure-meaning","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p12-market-failure-meaning-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=market-failure-meaning&tabId=market-failure-meaning","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"b7d9c5b"},{"id":"market-failure-factors::four-factors","scope":"economics","groupId":"market-failure-factors","groupTitle":"导致市场失灵的因素","groupTakeaway":"市场势力、外部性、公共物品特征和信息不对称，分别从竞争、交易外部影响、筹资激励及隐藏信息行为解释效率问题。每类机制都有成立条件，治理方式也应按条件选择。","title":"市场失灵的四类主要因素","content":"一般认为，导致市场失灵的原因主要包括垄断、外部性、公共物品和信息不对称。","label":"市场失灵的四类主要因素","note":"一般认为，导致市场失灵的原因主要包括垄断、外部性、公共物品和信息不对称。","learningGoal":"说出市场失灵的四类主要因素。","productionMode":"reuse","productionLabel":"直接复用","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"market-failure-factors","tabId":"market-failure-overview","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p13-market-failure-factors-overview-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=market-failure-factors&tabId=market-failure-overview","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"ab80ad60"},{"id":"market-failure-factors::market-power-efficiency","scope":"economics","groupId":"market-failure-factors","groupTitle":"导致市场失灵的因素","groupTakeaway":"市场势力、外部性、公共物品特征和信息不对称，分别从竞争、交易外部影响、筹资激励及隐藏信息行为解释效率问题。每类机制都有成立条件，治理方式也应按条件选择。","title":"市场势力如何影响配置效率","content":"具有市场势力的企业可能通过限制产量、提高价格，使产量偏离有效竞争下的水平，造成效率损失。判断这种影响需要分析供给控制和价格行为，不能只看企业规模大或价格高。","label":"市场势力如何影响配置效率","note":"具有市场势力的企业可能通过限制产量、提高价格，使产量偏离有效竞争下的水平，造成效率损失。判断这种影响需要分析供给控制和价格行为，不能只看企业规模大或价格高。","learningGoal":"说明市场势力如何影响配置效率的含义。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"market-failure-factors","tabId":"market-failure-monopoly","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p13-market-failure-monopoly-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=market-failure-factors&tabId=market-failure-monopoly","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"32d6a70d"}]